{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Behold.</b> Daughter of Zion: the daughter that she bore." "<b>And His recompense.</b> I have explained it (Isaiah 21:8)." "And the sense of <b>his reward</b>: that He will give good reward to those who endure the exile. Or its sense: that He will give good reward to whoever honors Israel."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 62, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:00:41.818334182Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}